# FinTrack database

- Every user-owned table has Row Level Security enabled; policies restrict rows to `auth.uid() = user_id` (or ownership via `profiles.id`).
- Migrations live in `supabase/migrations/`; prefer explicit constraints and indexes (unique per user/month for salary, dedup keys for imports).
- Do not bypass RLS with the service role in user-facing code paths; server routes use the user session client unless running a documented admin job.
- Never store secret API keys in the database in plaintext for client consumption; server env only.
